id: pm-brand-borders
title: Approve contract changes for low-contrast status borders
description: "Orchestrator declined border-colour changes: chip label text and fill carry state, so the border is decorative under WCAG 1.4.11. Canary, rose and rule stay unchanged. docs/contrast.md records all ten ratios below the 3:1 reference. Text remains subject to 4.5:1 and focus rings to 3:1. Classification and documentation implementation is covered by pm-brand-contrast."
type: Issue
status: canceled
priority: 2
