comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T23:34:45.360Z",codex-sol,"Orchestrator decision: chip state is carried by its text label (at least 4.5:1 in both themes) and fill. Borders are decorative and exempt from WCAG 1.4.11's 3:1 requirement. Retain canary, rose and rule tokens unchanged; classify the ten measured pairs as decorative and document the decision. Implementation in progress; awaiting orchestrator verification, do not close."
  "2026-10-16T23:40:05.667Z",codex-sol,"Decision applied: cancel the proposed border-colour changes because decorative borders have no 3:1 requirement. Canary, rose and rule remain unchanged. The ten measured ratios and reason are documented, and text/focus gates pass. Documentation and classification work is covered by pm-brand-contrast; this proposal is canceled, not closed."
